The Magnus desktop: what it is made of, where each part comes from, and its
licence. Every theme, font and icon set here may be redistributed (spec rev
145, "The desktop"). Each Debian package's full terms are in
/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright in this image.

Themes
  Magnus-Light, Magnus-Dark (GTK 3 and xfwm4)
    Source: Magnus, sandbox/desktop/make_theme.py. Made for Magnus; no other
    theme's files are copied. The GTK theme imports Adwaita from GTK itself.
    Licence: Magnus's own.
  Adwaita, the GTK 3 base theme (built into GTK)
    Source: Debian libgtk-3-common 3.24.38, https://www.gtk.org
    Licence: LGPL-2.0-or-later.

Fonts
  Inter (the interface)
    Source: Debian fonts-inter 4.0~beta7, https://github.com/rsms/inter
    Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  JetBrains Mono (the terminal)
    Source: Debian fonts-jetbrains-mono 2.242,
    https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
    Licence: Apache-2.0 as Debian packages this version (later versions
    are SIL Open Font License 1.1).

Icons
  Papirus, Papirus-Dark, Papirus-Light (recolored to the theme)
    Source: Debian papirus-icon-theme 20230104,
    https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme
    Licence: GPL-3.0. The recolored files are a modification under the same
    licence; the change is a color substitution made by
    sandbox/desktop/install.sh, which is its source.
  Adwaita cursors and fallback icons
    Source: Debian adwaita-icon-theme 43, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme
    Licence: LGPL-3.0 or CC-BY-SA-3.0 (some files CC-BY-SA-4.0).
  hicolor (the fallback icon theme)
    Source: Debian hicolor-icon-theme 0.17, https://icon-theme.freedesktop.org
    Licence: GPL-2.0-or-later.
  The Magnus star (the menu's icon)
    Source: Magnus, sandbox/desktop/make_theme.py. Licence: Magnus's own.

Wallpaper
  The Magnus wallpaper, light and dark
    Source: Magnus, the Wallpaper artboard
    (docs/design/team-and-computer/Wallpaper.dc.html), drawn by
    sandbox/desktop/make_theme.py and rendered with librsvg.
    Licence: Magnus's own.

